  "item_short_desc": "<p>Embrace patriotic pride with Rothco&rsquo;s US Flag / USMC Eagle, Globe, and Anchor T-Shirt. Crafted from durable and breathable 100% cotton, this tee showcases the historic USMC insignia alongside the American flag on the chest. Whether you're hitting the gym, running errands, or simply relaxing at home, this lightweight and comfortable shirt is perfect for exercise and casual wear.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133118",
  "description": "<p>Embrace patriotic pride with Rothco&rsquo;s US Flag / USMC Eagle, Globe, and Anchor T-Shirt. Crafted from durable and breathable 100% cotton, this tee showcases the historic USMC insignia alongside the American flag on the chest. Whether you're hitting the gym, running errands, or simply relaxing at home, this lightweight and comfortable shirt is perfect for exercise and casual wear. The iconic US flag is also featured on the right sleeve of the Marine Corps shirt, adding to its patriotic appeal. With a tagless label, you can enjoy irritation-free comfort all day long. Plus, this t-shirt is officially licensed by the United States Marine Corps, ensuring its authenticity. Show your support for the Marines while displaying your love for country with Rothco&rsquo;s US Flag / USMC Eagle, Globe, and Anchor T-Shirt.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
